  "body": "### Summary\n\nMVP priority, wanted by LOT-048 (#74): subject field, delete label ('Effacer l'intégralité du sujet'?), whether deleting the first post removes the whole topic (rf2 X1). The edit form is captured raw (operator's own Achat/Vente topic, edit + exact restore, approved 2026-10-27) and is being anonymized (part B of the public-writes capture). The delete answer is NOT authorised (it deletes a topic): stays pending unless the operator provides a throwaway topic.\n\n### Before you start\n\nRead AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, docs/FIXTURES.md, tooling/fixtures/README.md, docs/lots/LOT-001-*.md and LESSONS 33/34/36/39. Write captures need the operator's approval first. Anonymize, independent leak check, Fable corpus review before any push.\n",
